cff-version: 1.2.0
title: PLABench
message: >-
  If you use PLABench, cite the paper below. If you use the
  deposited inputs, structures, checkpoints or predictions on
  their own, cite the data DOI as well.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A leakage-controlled benchmark for protein-ligand binding
  affinity prediction. It runs nine models, sequence-based and
  structure-based, over the same targets under the same metrics,
  and varies the input structure so that pose quality can be told
  apart from model quality.
